WEBVTT

00:03.070 --> 00:05.370
<b>One, two,</b>

00:05.500 --> 00:06.740
<b>three,</b>

00:07.070 --> 00:08.440
<b>four,</b>

00:08.570 --> 00:10.110
<b>five, six,</b>

00:10.570 --> 00:12.210
<b>seven...</b>

00:13.680 --> 00:15.640
<b>Mother, I'm headed out now.</b>

00:16.280 --> 00:18.680
<b>Tatsuzo, where do you think you're going?</b>

00:19.010 --> 00:21.620
<b>The dojo, of course.</b>

00:22.120 --> 00:24.120
<b>From here on out, I'm devoted to the sword!</b>

00:26.620 --> 00:27.620
<b>Good day!</b>

00:30.630 --> 00:32.030
<b>Brother?</b>

01:36.460 --> 01:38.760
<b>CROSSROADS</b>

01:39.130 --> 01:40.760
<b>This isn't a laughing matter.</b>

01:41.100 --> 01:43.700
<b>It's as if he completely changed character!</b>

01:43.830 --> 01:46.600
<b>Relax, he's still young.</b>

01:46.740 --> 01:49.310
<b>He'll go through phases of fooling around</b>

01:49.440 --> 01:52.110
<b>and focusing on the sword and studies.</b>

01:52.240 --> 01:55.610
<b>It's the impulsiveness of being young.</b>

01:55.740 --> 01:57.410
<b>That's troublesome too.</b>

01:57.550 --> 01:59.380
<b>There's no need to worry.</b>

02:00.380 --> 02:04.390
<b>In any case, he's working hard to become
a well-rounded samurai.</b>

02:04.850 --> 02:06.890
<b>The sword is especially fascinating!</b>

02:07.220 --> 02:08.490
<b>Even more than beanbags?</b>

02:11.790 --> 02:14.230
<b>The sword comes with many encounters.</b>

02:14.360 --> 02:16.500
<b>Strong ones, scary ones,</b>

02:16.630 --> 02:18.170
<b>humorous ones.</b>

02:18.300 --> 02:19.400
<b>And then there are</b>

02:19.540 --> 02:21.800
<b>the curious ones,</b>

02:24.410 --> 02:26.310
<b>that make you believe in fate.</b>

02:41.820 --> 02:42.830
<b>Stop there!</b>

02:43.790 --> 02:45.690
<b>I surrender.</b>

02:52.640 --> 02:54.770
<b>-Next!
-Pardon me!</b>

03:09.250 --> 03:11.290
<b>My name is Jyubei Matsuoka.</b>

03:11.420 --> 03:13.690
<b>I'm here for a duel or two!</b>

03:14.360 --> 03:16.390
<b>Does he think he could defeat us all?</b>

03:18.290 --> 03:19.760
<b>Matsuoka!</b>

03:22.300 --> 03:25.670
<b>Let me, the elder, be your opponent.</b>

03:42.690 --> 03:43.720
<b>Darn it.</b>

03:43.850 --> 03:45.490
<b>I could have taken care of him.</b>

04:04.340 --> 04:06.710
<b>It's been at least half an hour!</b>

04:06.840 --> 04:09.480
<b>Why are they just glaring at each other?</b>

04:09.610 --> 04:12.780
<b>Look! Do you see his sweat?</b>

04:23.360 --> 04:25.530
<b>That's enough for today.</b>

04:25.660 --> 04:29.700
<b>I am truly grateful for this lesson.</b>

04:34.040 --> 04:35.640
<b>I request a duel!</b>

04:53.920 --> 04:56.360
<b>He got you good, Tetsu.</b>

05:02.030 --> 05:04.900
<b>But there was an awful lot of tension in the air.</b>

05:05.030 --> 05:07.670
<b>Who was that man?</b>

05:12.570 --> 05:13.680
<b>Darn.</b>

05:15.440 --> 05:18.580
<b>Tetsu, why don't we go for a drink
to forget about it?</b>

05:19.350 --> 05:23.490
<b>Yeah... But I'm a bit strapped for cash.</b>

05:24.690 --> 05:26.390
<b>Tetsusaburo.</b>

05:26.520 --> 05:27.690
<b>How have you been?</b>

05:28.490 --> 05:32.930
<b>Father, I'm extremely delighted to know that
you've been well too.</b>

05:34.060 --> 05:35.700
<b>That formality...</b>

05:36.600 --> 05:39.400
<b>You must be here to ask for this.</b>

05:43.610 --> 05:46.410
<b>Hurry, Hatsu's coming.</b>

05:48.780 --> 05:52.010
<b>How are things going at the dojo?</b>

05:52.720 --> 05:55.450
<b>-I'm devoted more than ever.
-Good.</b>

05:56.520 --> 05:59.020
<b>Tetsusaburo,</b>

05:59.350 --> 06:01.860
<b>I want you to know that I understand</b>

06:01.990 --> 06:04.730
<b>how you avoid this place because
of the resentment</b>

06:04.860 --> 06:06.460
<b>you cannot find an outlet for.</b>

06:06.860 --> 06:09.870
<b>That's why I had you go to Master Takasugi.</b>

06:10.870 --> 06:13.970
<b>He's the very one who disciplined me too.</b>

06:14.640 --> 06:16.770
<b>As long as you're studying under him,</b>

06:16.910 --> 06:19.780
<b>you'll never be on the wrong path.</b>

06:20.080 --> 06:21.780
<b>I'll take your words to heart.</b>

06:21.910 --> 06:24.680
<b>Nonsense, he comes from the evil path
in the first place.</b>

06:26.620 --> 06:27.750
<b>Hatsu!</b>

06:27.880 --> 06:32.720
<b>How generous of you to give allowance
to your runaway profligate son.</b>

06:33.160 --> 06:35.620
<b>No, you're mistaken.</b>

06:35.760 --> 06:36.790
<b>Mother.</b>

06:36.930 --> 06:38.490
<b>Who are you calling Mother?</b>

06:39.060 --> 06:42.130
<b>Your mother is a peasant in Sugamomura.</b>

06:42.460 --> 06:44.570
<b>I don't want an illegitimate child</b>

06:44.700 --> 06:46.840
<b>calling me a mother.</b>

06:46.970 --> 06:50.970
<b>Or do you still have regrets regarding
the heir of this house?</b>

06:51.110 --> 06:52.880
<b>When all you do is sneak in</b>

06:53.010 --> 06:55.880
<b>like a thieving cat
and use your father for money.</b>

06:57.710 --> 06:59.980
<b>He's a thief! Catch him!</b>

07:00.650 --> 07:01.880
<b>It's Tetsusaburo!</b>

07:02.020 --> 07:04.590
<b>Don't chase him down!</b>

07:06.190 --> 07:07.790
<b>Mother.</b>

07:07.920 --> 07:09.790
<b>How old will you be this year?</b>

07:09.930 --> 07:12.530
<b>Sooner or later,
if you don't settle matters regarding</b>

07:12.660 --> 07:14.160
<b>the heir, you'll be all parched up.</b>

07:14.500 --> 07:15.530
<b>Good day.</b>

07:17.470 --> 07:18.870
<b>Hey, Tetsu!</b>

07:19.000 --> 07:21.070
<b>Did something happen?</b>

07:21.200 --> 07:23.640
<b>Don't mind me, it's nothing.</b>

07:24.140 --> 07:25.970
<b>Hey, Tetsu!</b>

07:26.110 --> 07:27.980
<b>Hey, Hikojyu.</b>

07:28.110 --> 07:31.050
<b>Good to see both of you.</b>

07:31.650 --> 07:33.080
<b>Are you going for a drink?</b>

07:33.220 --> 07:35.680
<b>Or something more fun?</b>

07:37.820 --> 07:39.090
<b>It's both.</b>

07:39.220 --> 07:41.760
<b>Want to join us?</b>

07:41.890 --> 07:45.130
<b>I'd be honored to!</b>

07:47.500 --> 07:50.130
<b>Hey, Tetsu, you've been unfriendly recently.</b>

07:52.670 --> 07:54.870
<b>Tetsu, seems business is going well.</b>

07:55.000 --> 07:56.140
<b>Come and gamble.</b>

07:58.510 --> 08:00.740
<b>I lost!</b>

08:01.480 --> 08:02.740
<b>Wait!</b>

08:08.250 --> 08:09.790
<b>Bastard!</b>

08:26.900 --> 08:28.700
<b>What a night.</b>

08:28.840 --> 08:30.740
<b>But I feel refreshed now.</b>

08:30.870 --> 08:32.670
<b>Darn it.</b>

08:37.110 --> 08:38.710
<b>I stopped by my house.</b>

08:40.520 --> 08:42.650
<b>Well, well.</b>

08:45.090 --> 08:46.120
<b>Darn it.</b>

08:47.220 --> 08:49.260
<b>I went to pester for money</b>

08:49.590 --> 08:52.790
<b>while I knew that witch was going to be there.</b>

08:56.870 --> 08:58.070
<b>So pathetic...</b>

09:00.040 --> 09:02.670
<b>I'm pathetic!</b>

09:11.150 --> 09:13.080
<b>Maybe I should become a thief,</b>

09:13.220 --> 09:15.720
<b>just like you.</b>

09:15.850 --> 09:19.550
<b>Then I'll never have to see that woman's
face again.</b>

09:19.690 --> 09:21.560
<b>Don't be ridiculous.</b>

09:21.690 --> 09:23.090
<b>That was in the past.</b>

09:23.230 --> 09:26.560
<b>You run a bar called Thief Sake Shop.</b>

09:26.700 --> 09:28.630
<b>What nerve, man.</b>

09:30.070 --> 09:33.140
<b>It's more like a warning.</b>

09:33.270 --> 09:35.640
<b>Tetsu, let me tell you one thing.</b>

09:36.740 --> 09:39.040
<b>Control that temper.</b>

09:39.170 --> 09:41.340
<b>You're an honest person at heart.</b>

09:41.680 --> 09:45.250
<b>There's nothing worse than an honest
man becoming a thief.</b>

09:46.180 --> 09:51.090
<b>They try to cleanse their evil doings
by committing something more violent.</b>

09:51.220 --> 09:54.260
<b>They get lost in the darkness.</b>

10:00.330 --> 10:01.660
<b>Is he asleep?</b>

10:03.070 --> 10:04.670
<b>Oh, Tetsu.</b>

10:04.800 --> 10:07.740
<b>He's such a handful, every time.</b>

10:09.140 --> 10:10.670
<b>Tetsu, hey!</b>

10:11.070 --> 10:12.670
<b>You'll catch a cold.</b>

10:32.660 --> 10:34.800
<b>As we witnessed the other day,</b>

10:34.930 --> 10:37.400
<b>Matsuoka's skills with the sword were real.</b>

10:37.730 --> 10:40.240
<b>I convinced him to stay and teach</b>

10:40.370 --> 10:43.970
<b>so we could all learn from a great swordsman.</b>

10:45.410 --> 10:49.780
<b>I was overpowered by Master Takasugi's
passion and kindness.</b>

10:49.910 --> 10:51.950
<b>Poor as it is, thank you for having me.</b>

10:52.080 --> 10:54.880
<b>Thank you very much!</b>

10:55.980 --> 10:58.420
<b>I request a duel with you!</b>

11:51.310 --> 11:53.210
<b>He's</b>

11:53.340 --> 11:55.480
<b>a real swordsman.</b>

12:06.150 --> 12:10.830
<b>Your body's a mere puppet
without spirit and technique!</b>

12:11.290 --> 12:13.030
<b>Next!</b>

12:16.200 --> 12:18.870
<b>A puppet, eh?</b>

12:19.000 --> 12:21.240
<b>You need more practice.</b>

12:21.370 --> 12:24.270
<b>You're getting conceited about Matsuoka.</b>

12:24.410 --> 12:25.910
<b>Master!</b>

12:26.040 --> 12:27.840
<b>Call him Master Matsuoka!</b>

12:33.220 --> 12:35.450
<b>They've all livened up.</b>

12:35.780 --> 12:37.850
<b>Thanks to you, Matsuoka.</b>

12:37.990 --> 12:39.220
<b>Don't mention it.</b>

12:39.990 --> 12:42.820
<b>They're all promising young men to start with.</b>

12:44.930 --> 12:46.800
<b>How long are you staying in Edo?</b>

12:46.930 --> 12:49.430
<b>If you wish, you can stay...</b>

12:49.760 --> 12:51.330
<b>I cannot do that.</b>

12:51.470 --> 12:55.200
<b>Well, I'm just a poor samurai of Koshu.</b>

12:56.000 --> 12:58.140
<b>I didn't come to Edo for rations.</b>

12:58.270 --> 13:00.840
<b>I was here to take care of a relative.</b>

13:00.980 --> 13:02.480
<b>Is that so?</b>

13:02.810 --> 13:05.350
<b>Pardon me for my ignorance.</b>

13:05.850 --> 13:07.120
<b>Not at all.</b>

13:07.250 --> 13:11.420
<b>At my age, you can't help but think about
the here on out.</b>

13:12.290 --> 13:15.420
<b>I hope to find a successor soon.</b>

13:15.560 --> 13:18.930
<b>But none of them possess full mastery
of the sword.</b>

13:19.190 --> 13:20.800
<b>How about Hasegawa?</b>

13:20.930 --> 13:23.030
<b>He's strong, but not qualified.</b>

13:23.170 --> 13:25.330
<b>He uses the sword to vent his anger.</b>

13:26.840 --> 13:28.270
<b>Now that you mention it,</b>

13:28.400 --> 13:29.870
<b>compared to the other men,</b>

13:30.010 --> 13:32.370
<b>he has something beyond competitive spirit.</b>

13:32.510 --> 13:34.810
<b>I know his father as well.</b>

13:34.940 --> 13:37.510
<b>It won't be easy to straighten him out.</b>

13:38.010 --> 13:42.180
<b>Believe it or not, he's actually a pitiable fellow.</b>

13:47.920 --> 13:51.260
<b>So-called family matters...</b>

14:03.140 --> 14:05.110
<b>What's going on?</b>

14:05.240 --> 14:06.270
<b>Tetsu.</b>

14:06.410 --> 14:09.180
<b>They're the men from the gambling room
the other day.</b>

14:09.310 --> 14:10.380
<b>I see.</b>

14:11.250 --> 14:14.880
<b>So the swindlers are here to get their
money back?</b>

14:15.020 --> 14:18.590
<b>Our boss is not that stingy.</b>

14:19.250 --> 14:22.520
<b>He sent us to take your life.</b>

14:25.090 --> 14:26.160
<b>Intriguing!</b>

14:27.400 --> 14:29.930
<b>You bastard!</b>

14:30.070 --> 14:31.400
<b>Master Matsuoka?</b>

14:31.530 --> 14:33.130
<b>Stay out of this.</b>

14:33.270 --> 14:35.940
<b>-Who the heck are you?
-Here to fight?</b>

14:36.140 --> 14:37.140
<b>Master.</b>

14:37.440 --> 14:39.640
<b>-Stay out of this!
-Die!</b>

14:46.010 --> 14:47.520
<b>Bastard...</b>

14:47.650 --> 14:48.880
<b>Kill him!</b>

14:59.090 --> 15:00.300
<b>Darn it.</b>

15:07.400 --> 15:09.200
<b>Amazing.</b>

15:10.140 --> 15:11.410
<b>Hasegawa!</b>

15:11.570 --> 15:13.340
<b>-Come with me.
-Yes.</b>

15:17.080 --> 15:20.150
<b>Seems like you're well-known around here.</b>

15:20.280 --> 15:21.920
<b>No...</b>

15:24.050 --> 15:25.950
<b>Tetsu of Honjo, eh?</b>

15:26.090 --> 15:28.190
<b>Thanks, come again!</b>

15:28.460 --> 15:33.060
<b>Hearing your story, it reminded
me of myself when I was young.</b>

15:34.700 --> 15:37.470
<b>I also used to be quite the troublemaker.</b>

15:38.200 --> 15:41.270
<b>Liquor, women, gambling and fights.</b>

15:41.400 --> 15:43.470
<b>I'm surprised I made it this far.</b>

15:44.040 --> 15:45.570
<b>Master, you?</b>

15:45.710 --> 15:49.210
<b>I was peevish and begrudged the world.</b>

15:51.710 --> 15:56.550
<b>Actually... I'm an illegitimate child
of a high priest and his mistress.</b>

15:57.620 --> 16:00.060
<b>He was a high priest of a well-known temple,</b>

16:00.190 --> 16:03.360
<b>so it must've been bad for his reputation.</b>

16:03.490 --> 16:06.590
<b>My mother told me that she was given money</b>

16:06.730 --> 16:09.030
<b>to vanish from his sight.</b>

16:09.160 --> 16:11.370
<b>She passed away when I was twelve.</b>

16:12.300 --> 16:16.570
<b>Oh no, I'm spoiling the sake with this sad story.</b>

16:18.470 --> 16:20.380
<b>This is the point I wanted to make.</b>

16:21.240 --> 16:23.480
<b>Being dissolute and unruly is fine,</b>

16:23.610 --> 16:25.580
<b>that's what youth is about.</b>

16:26.680 --> 16:28.580
<b>But, Hasegawa...</b>

16:28.720 --> 16:32.550
<b>Just don't do anything that'll disrespect
Master Takasugi.</b>

16:32.690 --> 16:34.590
<b>That's the line you cannot cross.</b>

16:37.230 --> 16:38.290
<b>Yes.</b>

16:38.460 --> 16:42.230
<b>Fortitude and Vigor</b>

16:46.400 --> 16:49.570
<b>Tetsu, you're all fired up today.</b>

16:49.700 --> 16:52.440
<b>-I was born again!
-What?</b>

16:52.740 --> 16:56.440
<b>I decided to stop being peevish
and begrudging of the world!</b>

16:58.510 --> 17:00.150
<b>Hasegawa.</b>

17:00.280 --> 17:01.650
<b>Your family sent a messenger.</b>

17:10.390 --> 17:12.230
<b>It's been a while, Tetsusaburo.</b>

17:12.760 --> 17:15.630
<b>Remember me?
Your cousin, Kamesaburo Nagakura.</b>

17:16.560 --> 17:18.470
<b>Father...what is going on?</b>

17:18.600 --> 17:19.770
<b>You're the one who</b>

17:20.100 --> 17:22.340
<b>rushed me to choose the heir.</b>

17:22.770 --> 17:23.810
<b>So...</b>

17:24.140 --> 17:26.540
<b>I'm thinking of adopting Kamesaburo
as the heir.</b>

17:26.670 --> 17:28.180
<b>Hatsu, that's enough.</b>

17:28.310 --> 17:29.610
<b>Today's not the day--</b>

17:29.740 --> 17:32.610
<b>You'll never get anything done like that!</b>

17:33.110 --> 17:35.080
<b>Blood is crucial as the heir of a samurai.</b>

17:35.220 --> 17:39.120
<b>I'd much prefer a relative's son
over that of a mistress.</b>

17:40.590 --> 17:43.530
<b>What do you think, Tetsusaburo?</b>

17:44.130 --> 17:47.160
<b>Speak the truth, tell me what you think.</b>

18:00.280 --> 18:03.180
<b>What's so funny?</b>

18:05.350 --> 18:08.480
<b>Hey Tetsu, what's going on with you?</b>

18:08.620 --> 18:10.750
<b>What in the world happened?</b>

18:11.090 --> 18:13.320
<b>Hey, Tetsu!</b>

18:13.460 --> 18:16.590
<b>Tetsu, I looked for you everywhere!</b>

18:17.860 --> 18:19.390
<b>A big job?</b>

18:20.560 --> 18:22.430
<b>You're too loud.</b>

18:22.560 --> 18:25.370
<b>I know this wandering thief</b>

18:25.500 --> 18:28.170
<b>who's looking for some help</b>

18:28.300 --> 18:31.210
<b>with his next job.</b>

18:31.510 --> 18:35.140
<b>Don't worry, you're not helping him
with the break in.</b>

18:35.280 --> 18:38.410
<b>You just have to paddle the boat
there and back.</b>

18:38.550 --> 18:40.220
<b>It's set to happen in three days.</b>

18:40.350 --> 18:42.550
<b>His target is Kameso,
a restaurant in Asakusa.</b>

18:42.680 --> 18:44.420
<b>Your share is 50 ryo.</b>

18:44.550 --> 18:45.890
<b>Fifty ryo?</b>

18:48.290 --> 18:49.590
<b>Intriguing.</b>

18:50.230 --> 18:51.330
<b>What do you think, Sama?</b>

18:51.460 --> 18:52.730
<b>What?</b>

18:52.860 --> 18:55.230
<b>Fifty ryo is huge.</b>

18:55.360 --> 18:57.200
<b>It's a go!</b>

19:14.250 --> 19:15.620
<b>Hey, over here!</b>

19:17.590 --> 19:18.720
<b>Hurry!</b>

19:23.260 --> 19:25.460
<b>What are you doing?</b>

19:26.560 --> 19:28.530
<b>Hasegawa!</b>

19:29.460 --> 19:31.670
<b>-Master Matsuoka!
-What?</b>

19:31.800 --> 19:33.540
<b>Hasegawa!</b>

19:33.670 --> 19:35.700
<b>Have you forgotten my words?</b>

19:35.840 --> 19:38.940
<b>I told you not to disrespect Master Takasugi!</b>

19:40.810 --> 19:42.840
<b>You...</b>

19:43.380 --> 19:45.250
<b>You...</b>

19:46.680 --> 19:49.420
<b>You can't be like me!</b>

19:55.360 --> 19:57.430
<b>Master, we don't have much time.</b>

19:57.560 --> 19:59.660
<b>Please, hurry.</b>

20:18.410 --> 20:19.980
<b>Tetsusaburo.</b>

20:20.320 --> 20:22.380
<b>Samanosuke.</b>

20:23.280 --> 20:26.650
<b>Take care of Master Takasugi.</b>

20:31.690 --> 20:34.760
<b>Where did Master Matsuoka go after that?</b>

20:35.600 --> 20:39.000
<b>He never appeared at the dojo again.</b>

20:40.300 --> 20:44.270
<b>I don't know where he is now either.</b>

20:44.840 --> 20:48.810
<b>Jyubei Matsuoka was indeed a thief.</b>

20:49.540 --> 20:51.410
<b>He deceived Master Takasugi,</b>

20:51.550 --> 20:55.420
<b>betrayed all of us and vanished
into the darkness.</b>

20:55.550 --> 20:56.820
<b>But...</b>

20:58.590 --> 21:01.820
<b>But...even today, I sometimes stop and think...</b>

21:02.790 --> 21:06.530
<b>If Master Matsuoka wasn't there
for me at that time,</b>

21:06.660 --> 21:10.400
<b>Heizo Hasegawa of Arson Theft Control</b>

21:10.530 --> 21:13.370
<b>probably wouldn't be here today.</b>

21:19.640 --> 21:21.410
<b>Oh, I just forgot something.</b>

21:23.010 --> 21:24.350
<b>Gambling money?</b>

21:24.550 --> 21:25.780
<b>How did you know?</b>

21:26.050 --> 21:29.350
<b>You fool, I tricked you.</b>

21:30.420 --> 21:34.060
<b>I'm no match for you, Father.</b>

21:36.660 --> 21:38.430
<b>Come back by dawn.</b>

21:38.730 --> 21:40.500
<b>Are you letting me go?</b>

21:41.360 --> 21:42.400
<b>Hurry up and go.</b>

21:42.760 --> 21:44.500
<b>Thank you, Father!</b>

21:45.800 --> 21:46.800
<b>Tatsuzo!</b>

21:46.930 --> 21:47.940
<b>Yes?</b>

21:48.370 --> 21:50.610
<b>Being dissolute and unruly is fine,</b>

21:50.740 --> 21:52.910
<b>that's what youth is about.</b>

21:53.570 --> 21:54.940
<b>But...</b>

21:55.080 --> 21:58.350
<b>Just never do anything that'll disrespect
your teacher.</b>

21:59.580 --> 22:01.750
<b>That's the line you cannot cross.</b>

22:01.950 --> 22:02.950
<b>Yes!</b>

22:03.080 --> 22:04.990
<b>-Now go on!
-Good day!</b>

22:20.970 --> 22:27.110
<b>People are creatures born from dreams</b>

22:27.440 --> 22:32.980
<b>How can the sky look so blue?</b>

22:33.110 --> 22:38.950
<b>The past and future are just short-lived moments</b>

22:39.420 --> 22:44.760
<b>that exist between the blink of an eye</b>

22:47.730 --> 22:49.960
<b>Oh time…</b>

22:50.100 --> 22:53.970
<b>I could be a flower of spring</b>

22:54.100 --> 22:59.010
<b>in my next life</b>

22:59.910 --> 23:04.980
<b>And then…live on</b>

23:05.850 --> 23:11.150
<b>…and then…be loved</b>

23:11.920 --> 23:14.860
<b>La la la</b>

23:20.060 --> 23:23.560
<b>And then…cry</b>

23:26.870 --> 23:32.870
<b>…and then…fall</b>

23:41.750 --> 23:48.490
<b>Heizo remembers the robber,
who conducted an admirable robbery.</b>

23:49.060 --> 23:50.590
<b>And his name is...</b>

23:50.830 --> 23:53.530
<b>Next on Onihei,
"The End of Wasuke the Loach."</b>

23:53.660 --> 23:54.800
<b>The End of Wasuke the Loach</b>
